### Modelling notes
oge:FashionItem rdfs:comment "Fashion vocabulary should be aligned to Fashionpedia and relevant prior OWL fashion work before adding detailed category hierarchies."@en .
oge:MakeupItem rdfs:comment "Makeup categories should be derived from validated terminology and source fields; dataset tags must not be treated as authoritative ontology classes without review."@en .
